{"title":"Severance Scenes in Underwater Paint Swirls","link":"https://kottke.org/25/03/severance-scenes-in-underwater-paint-swirls","date":1742590250000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/willingham-severance-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/willingham-severance-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/willingham-severance-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1389\" alt=\"a man runs followed by a plume of blue smoke\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/willingham-severance-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/willingham-severance-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/willingham-severance-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1388\" alt=\"a man and woman dancing are surrounded by multicolored smoke\" /></p>\n\n<p>Using paint in water to simulate clouds or smoke, Rudy Willingham created <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/huMA7E83fmQ\">these magical scenes of characters from Severance</a> (<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DG3JdXkPSDB/\">Instagram</a>).</p>\n\n<p>Willingham also created <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/0AD6PmPMieA\">this cool animated zoetrope record</a> with dancing Severance characters.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Rudy%20Willingham\">Rudy Willingham</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Severance\">Severance</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/TV\">TV</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/03/severance-scenes-in-underwater-paint-swirls\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"53d17ebaa056b4b00b529ee203aeee9162ac5a97ee986386eb5a31322a5274e5","category":"Sites"}